OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer's behaviour in
OL,4,Acustody 'bizarre'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed three elderly men
OL,7,Fduring a psychotic episode after being
OL,8,Freleased from police custody behaved
OL,9,Fbizarrely while in his cell, an inquest
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FAlexander Lewis-Ranwell, now 35, was
OL,13,Farrested and released twice before he
OL,14,Fkilled Anthony Payne, 80, and twins
OL,15,FRoger and Dick Carter, 84 in Exeter on
OL,16,F10 February 2019.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
