OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer's behaviour in
OL,4,Acustody 'bizarre'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into their deaths heard
OL,7,Fhealthcare technician Alan Harness
OL,8,Fassessed Lewis-Ranwell during his
OL,9,Fsecond period of detention in
OL,10,FBarnstaple police station on 9
OL,11,FFebruary.
OL,13,FHarness told jurors Lewis-Ranwell did
OL,14,Fnot disclose his medical or mental
OL,15,Fhealth history, which jurors previously
OL,16,Fheard included a diagnosis of
OL,17,F"drug-induced psychosis or paranoid
OL,18,Fschizophrenia".
